From: Angelo Arifi <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 00:19:30 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] lane-298: qwen4exp MTP sidecar load + graph_mtp, target
 4-stream capture, Windows unmap_fragment trim (env-gated)

- qwen4exp: mtp_only sidecar loading (trunk absent), MTP block tensors (nextn eh_proj/enorm/hnorm,
  HC pair, dense attention, MoE + shared expert), LLM_GRAPH_TYPE_DECODER_MTP -> graph_mtp
- graph_mtp follows Strata mtp.cpp:462-650: one RMS norm over all 4 hc streams for the hidden input,
  fused eh_proj = [fc_embedding | fc_hidden], indexer dropped, the block's own final mixer
- target graph: t_h_nextn = last-layer 4-stream residual before the final mixer, all rows when unmasked;
  LLAMA_QWEN4EXP_MTP_RED=1 feeds the layer-0 input instead (selfcheck RED)
- create_memory: QWEN4EXP MTP context uses a plain KV cache over the nextn layer
- llama-mmap (Windows): unmap_fragment trims the working set via VirtualUnlock when LLAMA_WIN_UNMAP_FRAGMENT is set

Lane: lane-298
(cherry picked from commit db3d35de301f26f9ea02986518645e01aaf57057)

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - fork-authored (lane-298); no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: part of win W5, MTP drafting for Qwen3.8-Flash-Next (qwen4exp): plain 10.73 -> MTP n-max 3 p-min 0.5 16.64 t/s short (+55.0%), long 10.38 -> 15.14 (+45.8%); accept 91.5% / 78.2%; MEANS of 2 rounds, -lm dio. cache/mtp-x1-lane/cells/gate2c-10050216-* (state head = 1c80315817). Lane grade: "pending strict 2a" [release ledger Table 1 W5]
